      "message": "Mike: This would probably look something like\n```\ncros_sdk gdb ../platform/ec/twister-out/native_sim/drivers/drivers.raa489000/zephyr/zephyr.exe\n```\n\noutside the chroot or\n\n```\ngdb twister-out/native_sim/drivers/drivers.raa489000/zephyr/zephyr.exe\n```\ninside the chroot.\n\nIn `gdb`, you will probably want to do\n```\nhandle SIGUSR1 nostop noprint\nhandle SIGTTOU nostop\n```\nto avoid some annoying interruptions.\n\nYou can tell `zephyr.exe` to run a particular test like `zephyr.exe --test\u003dtcpc_raa489000:test_raa489000_get_rx_message_raw`, and it may be interesting to see whether this crash still happens when you run only this test.",
